LOCATION:Redbud Books
SUMMARY:Venezuela Talk with Dr. Yoletty Bracho at Redbud Books
DESCRIPTION:&#160\;Dr. Yoletty Bracho will examine neo-imperialism\, neoc
 olonialism\, and grassroots resistance\, drawing on the Venezuelan case. 
  Bracho is a researcher and adjunct professor of political science at the
  Université d'Avignon in southern France and an Impact+ postdoctoral fel
 low at the Université de Montréal. She holds a PhD in political sociolo
 gy from the Université Lumière Lyon 2 and specializes in participatory 
 public policy and left-wing activism in Venezuela. She is currently worki
 ng on her book manuscript\, Faire la Révolution dans l'État : participa
 tion et consolidation autoritaire au Venezuela\, with Éditions Terres de
  feu.
