SUMMARY:Global Gateways Online Open House
DESCRIPTION:IU's five Global Gateway (https://global.iu.edu/presence/gate
 ways/index.html) offices – in Accra\, Bangkok\, Berlin\, Mexico City\, 
 and New Delhi – facilitate a range of academic activities that increase
  IU's international visibility and impact and assists different stakehold
 ers of the IU community across the different campuses in establishing con
 nections and collaborations with local partners.With the help of the IU G
 lobal Gateways\, you can bring fresh perspectives\, opportunities\, and c
 onnections back to Indiana\, enriching our students and strengthening our
  state.  Members of the Gateway network cordially invite you to attend on
 e of the Online Open House sessions on:      Monday\, October 5\, 12 – 
 1 PM      orTuesday\, October 6\, 10 – 11 AM (https://events.iu.edu/ovp
 ia/event/2420003-global-gateways-online-open-house-2026-2)Join us to  ✅
  Discover funding opportunities for your international work  ✅ Learn ab
 out the dedicated support available for your international projects  ✅ 
 Bring global perspectives to your classroom and engage your students  ✅
  Meet the local Gateway teams who are in the regions to help on the groun
 dSchedule:        10:00 am                Introduction of the Global Gate
 way Network        Cathie Carrigan Director\, Global Gateway Network     
      &#160\;                10:10am                Overview of IU Global 
 grants and partnerships        Seth Walker Director for International Par
 tnerships        10:20 am                General Q&amp\;A with the Gatewa
 y Teams        ASEAN GatewayWanlaya (Koi) Pittayapitak Program Assistant\
 , ASEAN GatewayEurope GatewayAnnabell Türk Director\, Europe GatewayNata
 lia Aleksandrova Program Assistant\, Europe GatewayGhana GatewayAbigail O
 pong-Tetteh Program Manager\, Ghana GatewayIndia GatewayZafeena Suresh Di
 rector\, India GatewayMinu Thomas Program Manager\, India GatewayMexico G
 atewayMolly Fisher Director\, Mexico GatewayLía Juy Albarrán Communicat
 ions Coordinator\, Mexico GatewayQuetzalli Sánchez Clavel Academic and A
 dministrative Coordinator\, Mexico Gateway          &#160\;              
   11:00 am                End        Please register to attend.
