SUMMARY:Global Gateways Online Open House
DESCRIPTION:IU's five Global Gateway (https://global.iu.edu/presence/gate
 ways/index.html) offices – in Accra\, Bangkok\, Berlin\, Mexico City\, 
 and New Delhi – facilitate a range of academic activities that increase
  IU's international visibility and impact and assists different stakehold
 ers of the IU community across the different campuses in establishing con
 nections and collaborations with local partners.With the help of the IU G
 lobal Gateways\, you can bring fresh perspectives\, opportunities\, and c
 onnections back to Indiana\, enriching our students and strengthening our
  state.  Members of the Gateway network cordially invite you to attend on
 e of the Online Open House sessions on:Monday\, October 5\, 12 – 1 PM (
 https://events.iu.edu/ovpia/event/global-gateways-online-open-house2026) 
  or      Tuesday\, October 6\, 10 – 11 AM    Join us to  ✅ Discover f
 unding opportunities for your international work  ✅ Learn about the ded
