SUMMARY:HLS Global Development Consulting Applications Due
DESCRIPTION:GDC is a multidisciplinary\, student-led consulting program w
 here IU students from across majors and class years work in teams on real
 -world international development projects. Consultants collaborate with g
 lobal partner organizations\, tackle complex challenges\, and gain hands-
 on experience that goes far beyond the classroom.Through GDC\, you can:Wo
 rk on real international development projects  Collaborate with organizat
 ions and partners around the world  Build consulting\, research\, project
  management\, and communication skills  Learn about global challenges acr
 oss regions and sectors  Join a multidisciplinary community of students f
 rom across IU  Grow into leadership roles over multiple years in the Lab 
  No prior consulting or international development experience is required.
  If you're curious about global issues and want to put your skills to wor
 k on meaningful projects\, come learn what GDC is all about.  **must be a
 ble to attend weekly meetings on Fridays from 1:55-3:55  Ready to apply? 
 Click here (https://forms.gle/8RUQUNADfZG6QjR16)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  GDC is a multidisciplinary\, student-le
 d consulting program where IU students from across majors and class years
  work in teams on real-world international development projects. Consulta
 nts collaborate with global partner organizations\, tackle complex challe
 nges\, and gain hands-on experience that goes far beyond the classroom.</
 p><p><strong>Through GDC\, you can:</strong></p><ul><li>Work on real inte
 rnational development projects  </li><li>Collaborate with organizations a
 nd partners around the world  </li><li>Build consulting\, research\, proj
 ect management\, and communication skills  </li><li>Learn about global ch
 allenges across regions and sectors  </li><li>Join a multidisciplinary co
 mmunity of students from across IU  </li><li>Grow into leadership roles o
 ver multiple years in the Lab  </li></ul><p><strong>No prior consulting o
 r international development experience is required.</strong> If you're cu
 rious about global issues and want to put your skills to work on meaningf
 ul projects\, come learn what GDC is all about.</p><p>  **must be able to
  attend weekly meetings on Fridays from 1:55-3:55</p><p>  Ready to apply?
  <a href="https://forms.gle/8RUQUNADfZG6QjR16">Click here</a></p>
