 ters" session into practice\, but attendance at the earlier workshop is n
 ot required.</p><p>  This workshop will also help students prepare for th
 e Graduate Student Poster Session at the GAP Symposium at HLS on November
  7. Whether you have a complete draft or are still developing your poster
 \, you are welcome to participate.</p>
