 ses during an experiential learning opportunity. By completing the applic
 ation\, you will be considered for each scholarship the Walter Center has
  to offer.</p><p><strong>The application for Spring 2027 Experiential Lea
 rning scholarships closes on Sunday\, November 22.&#160\;</strong></p><p>
